#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-scheduling-your-new-code-to-run-intermittently.rst:80
#: 3b61bb14877a496898b4ec3b38103670
msgid ""
"So for example if you want your new code to run at 10Hz you could add it to "
"one of the case statements in the `ten_hz_logging_loop() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Copter.cpp#L333>`__"
" function found in `Copter.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Copter.cpp>`__."
msgstr ""
"例如，若希望新代码以 10Hz 运行，可将其添加到 `Copter.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Copter.cpp>`__"
" 中 `ten_hz_logging_loop() "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduCopter/Copter.cpp#L333>`__"
" 函数的某个 case 语句中。"
